1
00:00:00,013 --> 00:00:04,652
You look after everyone. Who
looks after you,

2
00:00:04,652 --> 00:00:05,812
between tasks?

3
00:00:05,862 --> 00:00:09,635
This is Serein. A little room to breathe.

4
00:00:09,685 --> 00:00:13,874
Serein makes room for you. A
two minute pause,

5
00:00:13,874 --> 00:00:16,201
with no streak to keep.

6
00:00:16,251 --> 00:00:20,013
Breathe in, gently. And let it go,

7
00:00:20,013 --> 00:00:21,626
without forcing it.

8
00:00:21,676 --> 00:00:24,711
Find the practice that fits the moment,

9
00:00:24,711 --> 00:00:26,879
from one minute to five.

10
00:00:26,929 --> 00:00:31,052
Tell Serein how you feel and
where you are,

11
00:00:31,052 --> 00:00:33,800
and it suggests the right reset.

12
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:40,912
Fifteen practices. Twelve illustrated
guides. Two minutes is enough.

13
00:00:40,912 --> 00:00:44,835
And nothing, ever, is monitored.

14
00:00:44,885 --> 00:00:50,794
Beautiful guides remind you that
pressure at work is shared,

15
00:00:50,794 --> 00:00:52,566
never yours alone.

16
00:00:52,616 --> 00:00:57,678
Gentle journeys guide you, one
small step at a time.

17
00:00:57,728 --> 00:01:01,721
Small tools for real shifts. Before,

18
00:01:01,721 --> 00:01:03,717
during, and after.

19
00:01:03,767 --> 00:01:08,531
Save what helps, and build a
routine that is yours.

20
00:01:08,581 --> 00:01:11,834
And if it is too heavy today,

21
00:01:11,834 --> 00:01:14,622
real support is one tap away.

22
00:01:14,672 --> 00:01:18,032
Follow a gentle square. Breathe in,

23
00:01:18,032 --> 00:01:22,510
hold, breathe out, rest. The
holds are optional,

24
00:01:22,510 --> 00:01:25,310
and the pace is yours.

25
00:01:25,360 --> 00:01:29,223
Ninety seconds for tired hands. Settle,

26
00:01:29,223 --> 00:01:36,307
open gently, and rest. Stop or adapt
whenever you need to.

27
00:01:36,357 --> 00:01:41,565
Choose from fifteen short
practices. Breathing,

28
00:01:41,565 --> 00:01:46,773
grounding, gentle movement,
awareness and visualisation.

29
00:01:46,823 --> 00:01:51,613
Build a one minute ritual
before your shift.

30
00:01:51,613 --> 00:01:55,805
Water, food, one settling
step, one intention,

31
00:01:55,805 --> 00:01:59,397
and one support to ask for.

32
00:01:59,447 --> 00:02:03,379
And when work itself is the problem,

33
00:02:03,379 --> 00:02:10,118
map it. Six work design areas help you
agree a positive change

34
00:02:10,118 --> 00:02:10,680
together.

35
00:02:10,730 --> 00:02:11,210
Serein is free, for everyone, always.

36
00:02:11,210 --> 00:02:11,610
Take your first pause today.

